WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.048 --> 00:00:05.697
Arsène Lupin had just finished eating and was feeling very pleased with himself. He took an expensive cigar from

2
00:00:05.698 --> 00:00:11.120
his pocket and started to examine it carefully. Just as he was about to remove the gold band

3
00:00:11.121 --> 00:00:16.866
around the cigar, his cell door opened. Lupin deftly tossed the cigar into a drawer while he moved forward

4
00:00:16.867 --> 00:00:23.937
to welcome his visitor with a warm smile. "I am ready for my daily exercise, dear boy," Lupin said

5
00:00:23.938 --> 00:00:30.596
to a guard waiting by the cell door. After the guard had led Lupin outside, two men entered the

6
00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:41.199
prisoner’s cell. One man was Inspector Dieuzy; the other was Inspector Folenfant. "What are we searching for again?"

7
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.437
asked Dieuzy. "Any evidence that Lupin has been communicating with someone outside the prison," replied Folenfant. On the previous

8
00:00:44.438 --> 00:00:51.754
evening, a well-known Paris newspaper had published these words addressed to the reporter covering Lupin’s court case: Monsieur: Your

9
00:00:51.755 --> 00:01:00.834
recent news story depicted me in a most unfavorable way. A few days before my trial, I will make

10
00:01:00.835 --> 00:01:06.739
you sorry for what you wrote. Arsène Lupin Clearly the letter had been written and signed by Arsène

11
00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:13.810
Lupin. Yet prisoners at the Santé Prison were forbidden to have contact with the outside, even through letters. "It’s

12
00:01:13.811 --> 00:01:25.652
obvious Lupin is arrogantly announcing that he plans to escape━and in the newspaper!" Monsieur Dudouis, the chief of the

13
00:01:25.653 --> 00:01:35.477
Paris police, had shouted. "This does not reflect well on the prison." He pointed to the two inspectors. "Tomorrow

14
00:01:35.478 --> 00:01:43.636
you will search his cell." So Dieuzy and Folenfant were now checking the bed linens, the cracks in

15
00:01:43.637 --> 00:01:54.866
the walls and the ceiling, and even the toilet. They were about to give up when Dudouis appeared. "Well?"

16
00:01:54.867 --> 00:01:59.049
said the police chief, quietly making his presence known. "We found nothing, sir," answered Dieuzy. "Wait a minute," said

17
00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:02.207
Folenfant suddenly. "I remember Lupin shutting that drawer just before the guard led him outside." "Well, let’s see,"

18
00:02:02.208 --> 00:02:10.778
said Dudouis, opening the drawer. He pulled out a stack of newspaper clippings that all related to Lupin. Some

19
00:02:10.779 --> 00:02:22.683
text was underlined and a few words were circled. "Perhaps this is some secret code," mused Dudouis. "Anything else?"

20
00:02:22.684 --> 00:02:28.016
"Just this cigar, sir," replied Folenfant, picking it up and handing it over to his superior. "Where did he

21
00:02:28.017 --> 00:02:38.167
get this?" demanded Dudouis. "It must have come with his breakfast, sir," said Folenfant. "Our friend Lupin has

22
00:02:38.168 --> 00:02:42.239
excellent taste," noted Dudouis, examining the gold band. Then he gently squeezed the cigar next to his ear to

23
00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:48.588
test its quality. "A good cigar should crackle a bit," he explained. But the cigar was flexible and made

24
00:02:48.589 --> 00:02:54.240
no sound. Upon further inspection the police chief noticed something white between the tobacco leaves. Delicately, with the aid

25
00:02:54.241 --> 00:03:01.390
of a toothpick he took from his pocket, Dudouis carefully removed a piece of very thin paper. He

26
00:03:01.391 --> 00:03:07.811
unrolled it and read: The basket has taken the place of the others. Eight out of ten are ready

27
00:03:07.812 --> 00:03:16.231
now. Press the outer foot on the plate and push downward. From 12 to 16 every day, H-P will

28
00:03:16.232 --> 00:03:25.366
wait. But where? Reply immediately. Don’t worry; your friend is here. Dudouis pondered the cryptic words. "Basket? I

