00:03:25.367 --> 00:03:40.795
think I know what that means, and ‘12 to 16’ must mean from noon until four o’clock," he said.

30
00:03:40.796 --> 00:03:52.938
"A very astute observation, sir," said Folenfant. "Lupin is definitely making plans to escape, sir," said Dieuzy. "But who

31
00:03:52.939 --> 00:03:57.263
or what is H-P?" "I don’t know," Dudouis replied and then added, "Apparently the prisoner has not read this

32
00:03:57.264 --> 00:04:05.247
